#: ../../source/1-getting_started/5-faq.md:169 922f1a98c11b4c54b404101fce032f30
msgid "Q: Gazebo crashes on launch"
msgstr "问：Gazebo 启动时崩溃"

#: ../../source/1-getting_started/5-faq.md:171 5899ff86edf848229d33507a33e7f6e4
msgid "Install all Gazebo packages:"
msgstr "安装全部 Gazebo 软件包："

#: ../../source/1-getting_started/5-faq.md:173 d39c70f2842843afa8cc38e4b17877a3
msgid "sudo apt install ros-jazzy-gz-*\n"
msgstr "sudo apt install ros-jazzy-gz-*\n"

#: ../../source/1-getting_started/5-faq.md:177 a9c7e96cc1c14cd09004c20ee45e1a5c
msgid "Check GPU drivers if using hardware rendering."
msgstr "若使用硬件渲染，请检查 GPU 驱动。"

#: ../../source/1-getting_started/5-faq.md:179 c197c4cf736e440486f93fd7710a8cbf
msgid "Q: Isaac Sim won't start or scripts fail"
msgstr "问：Isaac Sim 无法启动或脚本失败"

#: ../../source/1-getting_started/5-faq.md:181 ff346a42358845f383e3df3eed635718
msgid ""
"Use **FaSim-Isaac** `./init.sh` / `./run.sh`. Default Isaac path is "
"`ISAACSIM_DIR` (`~/isaacsim` unless overridden in "
"`config/fa_sim.local.conf`). Version for the optional Isaac ROS 2 "
"workspace comes from the `./init.sh` operation 2 menu (GitHub tags; "
"fallback in `config/fa_sim.conf`: `6.0.1` / `6.0.0` / `5.1.0`) — do not "
"assume a single hardcoded minor version."
msgstr ""
"使用 **FaSim-Isaac** 的 `./init.sh` / `./run.sh`。默认 Isaac 路径是 "
"`ISAACSIM_DIR`（除非在 `config/fa_sim.local.conf` 覆盖，否则为 `~/isaacsim`）。可选 "
"Isaac ROS 2 工作空间版本来自 `./init.sh` 操作 2 菜单（GitHub tag；回退见 "
"`config/fa_sim.conf`：`6.0.1` / `6.0.0` / `5.1.0`）— 不要假定某一个写死的次版本号。"

#: ../../source/1-getting_started/5-faq.md:183 72b18d8952474c1aa113a8c7189b00d9
msgid ""
"Confirm the directory in `ISAACSIM_DIR` exists and contains the launch "
"scripts named in `config/fa_sim.conf` (`isaac-sim.sh`, …)"
msgstr "确认 `ISAACSIM_DIR` 目录存在，且包含 `config/fa_sim.conf` 中的启动脚本（`isaac-sim.sh` 等）"

#: ../../source/1-getting_started/5-faq.md:184 db039f1c0eb44357921eddcec69f9c31
msgid ""
"Copy `config/fa_sim.local.template.conf` → `config/fa_sim.local.conf` if "
"Isaac is not at `~/isaacsim`"
msgstr ""
"若 Isaac 不在 `~/isaacsim`，复制 `config/fa_sim.local.template.conf` → "
"`config/fa_sim.local.conf`"

#: ../../source/1-getting_started/5-faq.md:185 bb11da8a5cf349719dc7b2afa350b694
msgid ""
"Re-run `./run.sh` and pick PhysX / Newton / Headless Streaming from the "
"menu (`./run.sh` has no `--headless` / `--robot` flags)"
msgstr ""
"再跑 `./run.sh`，从菜单选 PhysX / Newton / Headless Streaming（`./run.sh` 没有 "
"`--headless` / `--robot` 参数）"

#: ../../source/1-getting_started/5-faq.md:187 a7f1511007364721a7f91e662ccf6113
msgid "Q: Isaac Sim connection fails"
msgstr "问：Isaac Sim 连接失败"

#: ../../source/1-getting_started/5-faq.md:189 d2b1d2581c1e4560ba5258931e327a7e
msgid "Verify Isaac Sim is running (`./run.sh` from FaSim-Isaac)"
msgstr "确认 Isaac Sim 正在运行（从 FaSim-Isaac 执行 `./run.sh`）"

#: ../../source/1-getting_started/5-faq.md:190 5c6ab51af4fc43acbec1aa8a33b05f8b
msgid "Check that the topic bridge is active"
msgstr "确认话题桥接已激活"

#: ../../source/1-getting_started/5-faq.md:191 e8394a708db9458fb41680b6463164a5
msgid "Ensure `hardware:=isaac` is set in launch"
msgstr "确认 launch 中已设置 `hardware:=isaac`"

#: ../../source/1-getting_started/5-faq.md:192 74067af6a2b342b492d00367d8ba7843
msgid "Check Domain ID matches between Isaac and ROS 2"
msgstr "确认 Isaac 与 ROS 2 的 Domain ID 一致"

#: ../../source/1-getting_started/5-faq.md:194 cfdd6ad5075e46aabe5d9412839338e7
msgid "Network Configuration"
msgstr "网络配置"

#: ../../source/1-getting_started/5-faq.md:196 85327336d7eb4e95af3d346e9f8a2747
msgid "Q: How do I find the correct Domain ID?"
msgstr "问：如何查找正确的 Domain ID？"

#: ../../source/1-getting_started/5-faq.md:198 e3992bfce53a48fd957cbdc4df8d44c7
msgid ""
"The Domain ID is robot-specific. For internal deployments, consult your "
"robot's documentation or team lead. For development with mock hardware, "
"any ID works (default is 0)."
msgstr "Domain ID 因机器人而异。内部部署请查阅机器人文档或向团队负责人确认。使用模拟硬件开发时，任意 ID 均可（默认为 0）。"

#: ../../source/1-getting_started/5-faq.md:200 bc8bcbd27a894d198154d7f90eed232b
msgid "Q: Zenoh vs DDS?"
msgstr "问：Zenoh 与 DDS 如何选择？"

#: ../../source/1-getting_started/5-faq.md:202 6d64552a07bd461bba6b4686daa30b0d
msgid "**DDS (default):** Works out of the box for same-network communication"
msgstr "**DDS（默认）：** 同网通信即开即用"

#: ../../source/1-getting_started/5-faq.md:203 f995c341285443a1870b2e86bb5f6529
msgid "**Zenoh:** Better for cross-network, NAT traversal, or high-latency links"
msgstr "**Zenoh：** 更适合跨网络、NAT 穿透或高延迟链路"

#: ../../source/1-getting_started/5-faq.md:205 6881ce8fab5341bca4976b8aff3f0fb0
msgid "To use Zenoh:"
msgstr "使用 Zenoh："

#: ../../source/1-getting_started/5-faq.md:207 2f7fc0b27e41401da91445912d3c8baa
msgid ""
"sudo apt install ros-jazzy-rmw-zenoh-cpp\n"
"export RMW_IMPLEMENTATION=rmw_zenoh_cpp\n"
msgstr ""
"sudo apt install ros-jazzy-rmw-zenoh-cpp\n"
"export RMW_IMPLEMENTATION=rmw_zenoh_cpp\n"

